 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Causing a reaction",
   "texto": [
    "**Menakuti** is formed with **takut** and the **meng-...-i** config: the subject causes fear in the object. **Menyakiti** expresses cause damage or pain.",
    "The object of these verbs is who feels fear or pain: **Film itu menakuti penonton** («The movie scares the public»)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Direct an action to a place",
   "texto": [
    "In **mengunjungi desa** (visit a village) and **memasuki rumah** (enter a house), the verb with **-i** points to the place to which the action is directed. It is a frequent pattern, but each verb has its own meaning."
   ]
  },
